1. There are N BubbleCores (nodes) connected by N edges
2. The graph is guaranteed to be a collection of trees (N nodes, N edges, no cycles mentioned, but with "no BubbleCores connected with more than one line" - meaning max degree 1 for each edge endpoint in a tree... but we have N edges!)

